  "title": "The Son Does Not Know What the Father Knows",
  "part": "Part Two — Further Problems",
  "text": "God knows all things. Yahushua said there was a day and hour He did not know, and that only the Father knew it. Explain how one person of an all-knowing Godhead can be ignorant of what another person knows."
